<Page title="Privacy Policy — Nairon" description="How Nairon collects, uses, and protects personal data from our website, contact form, newsletter, and booking flow, and the rights you have over your data." eyebrow="Legal" heading="Privacy Policy" intro="This policy explains what personal data Nairon collects through this website, how we use it, who we share it with, and the rights you have over it." updated="July 25, 2026">
  <div class="page-body">
    <div class="page-prose">
      <p>Nairon AI ("Nairon", "we", "us") operates this website and the services described on it. This policy covers the personal data we handle when you visit the site, contact us, subscribe to our newsletter, or book a call. If you have questions, email us at <a href="mailto:hello@naironai.com">hello@naironai.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>We collect only the data we need to respond to you and run the site:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Newsletter.</strong> If you subscribe, we collect your email address.</li>
        <li><strong>Contact form.</strong> When you reach out, we collect the email address and any details you include in your message.</li>
        <li><strong>Booking details.</strong> When you book an AI audit, our scheduling provider (Cal.com) collects your name, email, chosen time, and anything you add to the booking notes.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics data.</strong> As you use the site, we collect standard analytics data such as pages viewed, referring links, approximate location, device and browser type, and similar usage signals.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Analytics &amp; cookies</h2>
      <p>We use Google Analytics 4 (via the <strong>gtag</strong> tag) to understand how the site is used and to improve it. Google Analytics sets cookies in your browser to distinguish visitors and measure sessions. These cookies collect the usage and device data described above.</p>
      <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. Doing so does not stop you from using the site, though some measurement will no longer work.</p>

      <h2>How we use data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to inquiries you send us and follow up on booked calls.</li>
        <li>To provide, operate, and improve the service and this website.</li>
        <li>To send the newsletter, only if you have opted in. You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in each email or by emailing us.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell personal data, and we do not use it for purposes unrelated to those above without telling you first.</p>

      <h2>Third parties and processors</h2>
      <p>We rely on a small set of service providers to run the site and its features. Each processes personal data only to provide its service to us:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> &mdash; website analytics and measurement.</li>
        <li><strong>Cal.com</strong> &mdash; scheduling and booking for AI audit calls.</li>
        <li><strong>Vercel</strong> &mdash; hosting and delivery of this website.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These providers may process data in accordance with their own privacy terms. We share only what each provider needs to perform its function.</p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>We keep personal data only as long as we need it for the purpose it was collected, or as long as required by law. Contact and booking messages are retained while we handle your request and for a reasonable follow-up period afterward. Newsletter data is kept until you unsubscribe. Analytics data is retained according to our Google Analytics configuration. When data is no longer needed, we delete it or anonymize it.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on where you live, you have rights over your personal data. We honor these requests regardless of location where we reasonably can.</p>
      <h3>GDPR (EEA and UK)</h3>
      <p>If you are in the European Economic Area or the United Kingdom, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Access</strong> the personal data we hold about you.</li>
        <li><strong>Rectification</strong> of inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
        <li><strong>Erasure</strong> of your data in certain circumstances.</li>
        <li><strong>Objection</strong> to certain processing, including direct marketing.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>CCPA / CPRA (California)</h3>
      <p>If you are a California resident, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Know</strong> what personal data we collect and how we use it.</li>
        <li><strong>Delete</strong> the personal data we hold about you.</li>
        <li><strong>Opt out of the sale</strong> of personal data. Nairon does not sell personal data, so there is nothing to opt out of, but you may still submit a request.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:hello@naironai.com">hello@naironai.com</a>. We will not discriminate against you for making a request.</p>

      <h2>International transfers</h2>
      <p>We are based in the United States, and our service providers may process data in the United States and other countries. If you access the site from outside the United States, your data may be transferred to and stored in a country with different data protection laws than your own. Where required, we rely on appropriate safeguards for these transfers.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This service is not directed to children under 16, and we do not knowingly collect personal data from them. If you believe a child has provided us with personal data, email us at <a href="mailto:hello@naironai.com">hello@naironai.com</a> and we will delete it.</p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect personal data, and our providers apply scoped, audited access to the systems that handle it. You can read more in our <a href="/security">security practices</a>. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy as our practices or the law change. When we do, we will revise the date at the top of this page. Significant changes will be communicated where appropriate. Please review this page periodically.</p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>For any question or request about this policy or your data, contact us at:</p>
      <p><strong>Nairon AI</strong><br />
      2125 Biscayne Blvd<br />
      Miami, FL 33137<br />
      <a href="mailto:hello@naironai.com">hello@naironai.com</a></p>

